  title: An incomplete record
  category: ARCHIVE / 03-03 / SYSTEM RECORD
  body: 'The dial continues after the working day has ended.


    The archive leaves
    three questions open: who worked here, what were they told, and whose account
    was allowed to remain?


    The record remains open.'
